       "blocks": [
        {
         "id": "b_9mlkjo2s",
         "type": "text",
         "props": {
          "html": "<p>Wildlife boats give you ninety minutes and a wet coat. A small ship gives you the whole week: the minke that surfaces beside the hull at breakfast, the sea eagle that works the same headland every evening, the hour at Enniberg when the air is more bird than sky.</p><p>A naturalist sails on every northern departure. Not a lecturer with a projector: a person with binoculars who knows which ledge, which tide, which month.</p>"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "col_9r66hxpb",
       "width": 40,
       "align": "top",
       "flow": "stacked",
       "box": {
        "padding": {
         "top": 0,
         "right": 0,
         "bottom": 0,
         "left": 0
        },
        "radius": 0,
        "borderWidth": 0,
        "shadow": "none",
        "blur": 0
       },
       "blocks": [
        {
         "id": "b_9o90lspx",
         "type": "icon-item",
         "props": {
          "icon": "eye",
          "title": "Deck-height viewing",
          "body": "Four metres off the water, not forty. You see the eye, not the back.",
          "align": "left"
         }
        },
        {
         "id": "b_9p1gkjzr",
         "type": "icon-item",
         "props": {
          "icon": "compass",
          "title": "The master diverts",
          "body": "A blow on the horizon outranks the timetable. It is that kind of ship.",
          "align": "left"
         }
        },
        {
         "id": "b_9qh99656",
         "type": "icon-item",
         "props": {
          "icon": "sparkle",
          "title": "A naturalist aboard",
          "body": "On every Scottish, Faroese and Norwegian departure.",
          "align": "left"
         }
