       "blocks": [
        {
         "id": "b_9z1etgyq",
         "type": "heading",
         "props": {
          "level": "h2",
          "html": "The regulars",
          "align": "left"
         }
        },
        {
         "id": "b_a08d2kcz",
         "type": "text",
         "props": {
          "html": "<p>Six you have a fair chance of meeting, and how the crew announce each one.</p>"
         }
        },
        {
         "id": "b_ajud6d1d",
         "type": "grid",
         "props": {
          "across": "3",
          "acrossTablet": "2",
          "acrossPhone": "1",
          "gap": 24,
          "align": "stretch",
          "columns": [
           {
            "id": "col_a35ss613",
            "width": 16.65,
            "blocks": [
             {
              "id": "b_a1cvjb8x",
              "type": "heading",
              "props": {
               "level": "h4",
               "html": "Minke whale",
               "align": "left"
              }
             },
             {
              "id": "b_a2azepte",
              "type": "text",
              "props": {
               "html": "<p>The reliable one. Announced with a bearing and a kettle count: two minutes to the rail, tea survives.</p>"
              }
             }
            ]
           },
           {
            "id": "col_a6r7dawh",
            "width": 16.67,
            "blocks": [
             {
              "id": "b_a433fqku",
              "type": "heading",
              "props": {
               "level": "h4",
               "html": "Orca",
               "align": "left"
              }
             },
             {
              "id": "b_a5fzzhe9",
              "type": "text",
              "props": {
               "html": "<p>The stop-everything one. The engine comes out of gear and the announcement is one word, quietly.</p>"
              }
             }
            ]
           },
           {
            "id": "col_a9npfbyp",
            "width": 16.67,
            "blocks": [
             {
              "id": "b_a7dkbwrq",
              "type": "heading",
              "props": {
               "level": "h4",
               "html": "White-tailed eagle",
               "align": "left"
              }
             },
             {
              "id": "b_a8njijn3",
              "type": "text",
              "props": {
               "html": "<p>A door on wings. Works the same headlands every evening, which the naturalist knows by name.</p>"
              }
             }
            ]
           },
           {
            "id": "col_acqo60rk",
            "width": 16.67,
            "blocks": [
             {
              "id": "b_aa0s3rot",
              "type": "heading",
              "props": {
               "level": "h4",
               "html": "Puffin",
               "align": "left"
              }
             },
             {
              "id": "b_abyrd5mk",
              "type": "text",
              "props": {
               "html": "<p>April to early August, then gone to sea for the year. The only bird guests applaud.</p>"
              }
             }
            ]
           },
           {
            "id": "col_afp73d50",
            "width": 16.67,
            "blocks": [
             {
              "id": "b_adn5kxnm",
              "type": "heading",
              "props": {
               "level": "h4",
               "html": "Gannet",
               "align": "left"
              }
             },
             {
              "id": "b_ae0o391b",
              "type": "text",
              "props": {
               "html": "<p>Hits the water at sixty miles an hour off Shetland. The naturalist has opinions about their manners.</p>"
              }
             }
            ]
           },
           {
            "id": "col_aiys69if",
            "width": 16.67,
            "blocks": [
             {
              "id": "b_agj3a420",
              "type": "heading",
              "props": {
               "level": "h4",
               "html": "Common dolphin",
               "align": "left"
              }
             },
             {
              "id": "b_ahojrljp",
              "type": "text",
              "props": {
               "html": "<p>Rides the bow most warm-water passages. Nobody has ever gone below while they are there.</p>"
              }
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     ],
     "gap": 32,
     "stackBelow": "mobile",
     "reverseOnStack": false
