          "caption": "Entries as the bridge wrote them. The log does not do adjectives.",
          "textColour": "",
          "data": "Date\tPosition\tEntry\n14 Jun\tOff Mykines\tOrca, pod of five, twenty minutes. Engine out of gear.\n02 Jul\tSound of Canna\tMinke surfaced alongside at breakfast. Porridge abandoned.\n19 Jul\tHjørundfjord\tSea eagle took a fish at fifty metres. Guest wept. Understandable.\n08 Aug\tOff Vis\tCommon dolphin on the bow, forty minutes, both watches.\n21 Aug\tEnniberg\tAir more bird than sky. Log keeper gave up counting."
